  "benchmark_sha256": "1cfbf82f73da592293ae30651ee6e0f3d924f9ab8f832193f1451f892cf18079",
  "method": "Three paired runs per workload, alternating order. Train 10000 MCCFR iterations with seed7, then time every profile and best-response pass of the local exact evaluator. Training is outside evaluation_seconds. Full single-bet root and conditional first-hand-fixed roots for both formats. Raises-to-eight full root was not measured. The same benchmark binary was verified byte-identical after documentation/comment/build-alias changes.",
  "scope_note": "first-hand-fixed has a known P0 hand and enumerates P1 hands. Its metrics describe a conditioned subproblem, not full-game root exploitability. visited_nodes and information_sets are training counters, not evaluation node counts.",
  "measurement_limit": "The original full-root runs range from 178.44 to 302.16 seconds. Medians and all raw observations are retained; this variability limits precise speedup claims. No own builds or tests ran concurrently.",
